pageType: chapter
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
- elementId: top-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: left-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 120, 4, 80]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [80, 110, 1100, 50]
  content:
    fontSize: 36
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      <p><strong>方向07：RISC-V 基础安全 primitives</strong></p>
- elementId: subtitle
  elementType: text
  bounds: [80, 160, 1100, 35]
  content:
    fontSize: 24
    color: $secondary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      从标准规范到安全 substrate 的技术演进
- elementId: intro
  elementType: text
  bounds: [80, 220, 1100, 70]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      把 PMP/ePMP/Smepmp、IOMMU、IOPMP、AIA、CFI 等 substrate 与 TEE 本体区分开。先用三篇主讲材料建立演进关系，再用证据等级控制每个结论。
- elementId: papers
  elementType: text
  bounds: [80, 300, 1100, 300]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.6
    text: |
      <ul>
      <li>RISC-V privileged architecture — 开创/基础入口（E0 / 基础证据 standard substrate）</li>
      <li>RISC-V IOMMU — 代表性改进（E0 / Spec-standard SOTA）</li>
      <li>RISC-V Advanced Interrupt Architecture — 当前 SOTA/补充边界（E0 / Spec-standard SOTA）</li>
      </ul>
- elementId: bottom-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
